---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Serving 40 Countries - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group celebrates serving 40 countries worldwide with premium kitchen appliances, marking significant milestone in global expansion as trusted OEM manufacturer for international brands.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Company</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Company</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Serving 40 Countries: HouseTech's Global Journey in Kitchen Appliances</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 January 2023</span>
            <span>🏷️ Company</span>
            <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0e7490);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">HouseTech Global Presence</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>January 2023 marks a significant milestone for HouseTech Group as we celebrate serving customers in 40 countries across six continents. What began as a domestic Chinese manufacturer has evolved into a globally recognized OEM kitchen appliance partner trusted by leading brands worldwide. This journey reflects HouseTech's unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and customer partnerships.</p>
          
          <p>From humble beginnings in a small Shenzhen workshop in 2012, HouseTech has grown into a sophisticated manufacturing enterprise with ISO-certified facilities, advanced R&D capabilities, and established distribution networks spanning from Europe to Southeast Asia and the Americas.</p>
          
          <h2>Geographic Expansion Timeline</h2>
          <p>HouseTech's international growth has followed a strategic progression:</p>
          
          <ul>
            <li><strong>2015:</strong> First export orders to Southeast Asian markets, establishing initial international presence.</li>
            <li><strong>2017:</strong> European market entry through partnerships with distributors in Germany and France.</li>
            <li><strong>2019:</strong> North American certification and market entry, marking presence in all major markets.</li>
            <li><strong>2021:</strong> South American market development, completing global geographic coverage.</li>
            <li><strong>2023:</strong> 40-country milestone, representing customers on every inhabited continent.</li>
          </ul>

          <blockquote>
            "Reaching 40 countries is meaningful not just as a number, but as evidence of the trust placed in HouseTech by partners around the world. Every market presents unique challenges—different regulations, consumer preferences, and business practices. Our team's ability to adapt while maintaining consistent quality is what makes global expansion possible."
            <cite>— HouseTech Group CEO</cite>
          </blockquote>

          <h2>Market-Specific Approaches</h2>
          <p>HouseTech recognizes that successful international business requires more than shipping products across borders. The company has developed deep market expertise:</p>
          
          <p>European markets demand premium quality, energy efficiency, and sophisticated design aesthetics. North American partners prioritize safety certification, competitive pricing, and reliable supply. Asian markets often require customized features and flexible order quantities.</p>

          <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
          <p>HouseTech's 40-country presence is a foundation, not a ceiling. The company has identified significant growth opportunities in emerging markets where kitchen appliance penetration remains low. African markets, in particular, represent the next frontier for expansion.</p>
          
          <p>HouseTech extends sincere gratitude to all partners, employees, and customers who have contributed to this global journey. The next 40 countries await, and HouseTech is prepared for the adventure ahead.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/energy-efficient-eu-aplusplus" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">Energy Efficient Products</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/german-brand-oem-success" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">German OEM Success Story</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>